# Snippet for HDS Apache vhost (already applied on CT 137).
# Same-origin reverse proxy so Designs View can load Visio/draw.io via lightbox #U
# without the diagrams.net /proxy servlet (static nginx deploy has none).
#
# Requires: a2enmod proxy proxy_http
#
#    ProxyRequests Off
#    ProxyPreserveHost Off
#    ProxyPass        /incur/drawio/ http://192.168.1.10:8080/
#    ProxyPassReverse /incur/drawio/ http://192.168.1.10:8080/
#    RedirectMatch ^/incur/drawio$ /incur/drawio/
